WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.478
The loom follows each idea through your paragraphs.

2.1
00:00:04.478 --> 00:00:08.574
It’s solid where you develop an idea, dotted where it runs underneath,

2.2
00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:12.671
knotted where two ideas pull against each other, and frayed where you drop it.

3.1
00:00:13.271 --> 00:00:17.023
It even catches new ideas that first appear in your conclusion.
